## 7. Test Scenarios After Fix

| Scenario | Expected Result |
|----------|-----------------|
| User with BASIC_PLUS_CUSTOM opens Add dialog | Baseline symbols NOT in available list |
| User with CUSTOM_ONLY opens Add dialog | All DB symbols shown (no baseline) |
| User adds symbol via dialog | Symbol appears on QuotesScreen immediately |
| User opens Manage dialog | Only custom subscriptions shown |
| Admin removes custom permission | Icons disappear, dialogs close |

